{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your deck of cards and units, form your army. Use your cards with your army in battle against challenging lords to save and rebuild the kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/CardGif1.gif?t=1743193359\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building Unit Deck</strong>: Players can create a unit deck as deck of cards. Units can be selected based on their strength, class and type, this adds strategic depth to the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trigger Mechanic</strong>: Cards are triggered depending on the power, class and type of units in the army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Card Upgrade</strong>: Cards can be upgraded in two ways. <strong>Card Level</strong> increases the damage, <strong>Position Level</strong> allows the card to deal damage to multiple enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map System</strong>: The map consists of 10 regions, each region branching into 3 different paths. Choose the path that suits you best and shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Position Cards</strong>: This card allows players to change enemy positions randomly or on request, this provides strategic depth on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/CardGif2.gif?t=1743193359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906660?t=1743193359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/